{
  "name": "deploykit - issue triage (core)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## deploykit - issue triage core\n\nThe shared funnel both inlets call. Input: `{ source, customer, raw_text, link?, reported_at? }`.\n\n**Setup (once):**\n1. In **Config**, set `linear_team_id` (Linear → team settings → copy team ID, a UUID).\n2. Attach your **Linear** credential on `Search Linear`, `Create Linear Issue`, and `Add Occurrence Comment`.\n3. Attach your **OpenAI** credential on the chat model node - or swap that node for any other provider, nothing else changes.\n\nDon't run this standalone; import it first, then point the inlet workflows' *Run Issue Triage* node at it.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111100",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101",
      "name": "Triage Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "linear_team_id",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_LINEAR_TEAM_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "max_candidates",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111102",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the triage step of a deployment feedback funnel for an AI product. A field report has arrived from a customer deployment; normalize it into an issue.\n\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\nDeployment/customer: {{ $json.customer }}\nRaw report:\n<<<\n{{ $json.raw_text }}\n>>>\n\nRules:\n- title: short and root-cause oriented - describe the underlying failure, not this specific occurrence.\n- summary: 2–3 sentences that an engineer who wasn't there can act on.\n- system: the platform component or integration involved, if inferable.\n- severity: blocker | major | minor.\n- sanitized_context: the useful specifics (error shapes, frequency, timing) with ALL customer-identifying data removed - no names, IDs, credentials, or document contents. Describe the shape of the data, never the data itself.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111103",
      "name": "Extract & Sanitize",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111104",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [500, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE_ME",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"summary\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"system\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"severity\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"blocker\", \"major\", \"minor\"] },\n    \"sanitized_context\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"title\", \"summary\", \"sanitized_context\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111105",
      "name": "Issue Schema",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [700, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.linear.app/graphql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "linearApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: \"query Search($term: String!, $first: Int) { searchIssues(term: $term, first: $first) { nodes { id identifier title description url } } }\", variables: { term: $json.output.title, first: $('Config').item.json.max_candidates } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111106",
      "name": "Search Linear",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "linearApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE_ME",
          "name": "Linear account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A new field report was normalized into this issue:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output) }}\n\nExisting candidate tickets from the tracker (may be empty):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data.searchIssues.nodes) }}\n\nDecide whether the new report shares the SAME UNDERLYING ROOT CAUSE as one of the candidates - meaning a fix for that candidate would also fix this report. Similar symptoms in different components do NOT match. If the candidate list is empty or nothing matches, return match=false.\nIf match=true, issue_id MUST be exactly the \"id\" of the matching candidate.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111107",
      "name": "Judge Root Cause",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [960, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"match\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n    \"issue_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"reason\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"match\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111108",
      "name": "Match Schema",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1100, 240]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.match }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111109",
      "name": "Existing Ticket?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1200, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.linear.app/graphql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "linearApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: \"mutation CreateIssue($input: IssueCreateInput!) { issueCreate(input: $input) { success issue { id identifier url } } }\", variables: { input: { teamId: $('Config').item.json.linear_team_id, title: $('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.title, description: $('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.summary + '\\n\\n**System:** ' + ($('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.system || 'unknown') + '\\n**Severity (reported):** ' + ($('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.severity || 'minor') + '\\n\\n### Context (sanitized)\\n' + $('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.sanitized_context + '\\n\\n---\\n_Filed by deploykit triage from a ' + ($('Config').item.json.source || 'unknown') + ' report._' } } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-11111111110a",
      "name": "Create Linear Issue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1440, 140],
      "credentials": {
        "linearApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE_ME",
          "name": "Linear account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "issue_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.output ? $json.output.issue_id : $json.data.issueCreate.issue.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "action",
              "value": "={{ $json.output ? 'occurrence_added' : 'created' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "name": "identifier",
              "value": "={{ $json.output ? ($('Search Linear').item.json.data.searchIssues.nodes.find(n => n.id === $json.output.issue_id) || {}).identifier : $json.data.issueCreate.issue.identifier }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "name": "issue_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.output ? ($('Search Linear').item.json.data.searchIssues.nodes.find(n => n.id === $json.output.issue_id) || {}).url : $json.data.issueCreate.issue.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-11111111110b",
      "name": "Normalize Issue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1680, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.linear.app/graphql",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "linearApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: \"mutation AddComment($input: CommentCreateInput!) { commentCreate(input: $input) { success comment { id url } } }\", variables: { input: { issueId: $json.issue_id, body: '[occurrence] deployment: ' + ($('Config').item.json.customer || 'unknown') + ' · source: ' + ($('Config').item.json.source || 'unknown') + ' · ' + $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') + '\\n\\n> ' + ($('Extract & Sanitize').item.json.output.sanitized_context || '').replaceAll('\\n', '\\n> ') + ($('Config').item.json.link ? '\\n\\nOriginal report: ' + $('Config').item.json.link : '') } } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-11111111110c",
      "name": "Add Occurrence Comment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1900, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "linearApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE_ME",
          "name": "Linear account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
              "name": "action",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Issue').item.json.action }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
              "name": "identifier",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Issue').item.json.identifier }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
              "name": "issue_url",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Issue').item.json.issue_url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Issue').item.json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-11111111110d",
      "name": "Return Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [2120, 0]
    }
  ],
